  ╭─ commands ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╮
  │ /new                  fresh session (also /clear)                          │
  │ /model [id]           pick from the catalog, or switch to any id           │
  │ /models [query]       search the endpoint's model list: window and price   │
  │ /skills [name]        list the skill library, or run one (also /<name>     │
  │                       <request>)                                           │
  │ /memory               show what construct remembers                        │
  │ /learn                run the learning pass now                            │
  │ /status               session id, journal and totals                       │
  │ /copy [error|status]  last reply (or last tool error, or status) to the    │
  │                       clipboard                                            │
  │ /help                 this list (also /?)                                  │
  │ /quit                 exit (also /exit, /q)                                │
  ╰────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╯
  ╭─ skills ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╮
  │ /release-crate  Publish a release of a Rust crate                          │
  ╰────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╯
  ╭─ keys ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╮
  │ enter               send                                                   │
  │ / ↑↓ tab            commands and skills as you type; esc closes            │
  │ alt+enter ctrl+j    newline                                                │
  │ esc                 interrupt                                              │
  │ ctrl+o              expand tool output                                     │
  │ wheel ↑↓ pgup pgdn  scroll                                                 │
  │ ctrl+p ctrl+n       input history                                          │
  │ ctrl+c              clear the input, then quit                             │
  ╰────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╯
   select text with the mouse (shift-drag if your terminal asks for it); /copy
   works over ssh

